From 0e84b52acb4caef2af43cbdb563d44120bcc0216 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrian Gruntkowski <adrian.gruntkowski@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 14:45:42 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add ability to smoothly update TOTP configuration (#6420)

* Add vault fallback key to runtime configuration

* Add fallback vault and run it as a part of application

* Add fallback encrypted binary ecto type

* Add `totp_secret_fallback` to `User` schema

* Make TOTP logic account for fallback secret

* Add backfill migration script for totp_secret_fallback from totp_secret

* Add overwrite data migration script for totp_secret

* Send error to sentry on failed TOTP secret decode

* Clean up runtime config slightly

* Fix Sentry capture message call

* Add test for the fallback vault

* Add integration test for the whole rotation procedure

* Add more context to data migration notices

* Rename test

* Address unrelated credo issues in touched modules

* Modify the rotation procedure

* Fix typos
